  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Objective 1: Facilitate strategic engagement to advance policy commitments on security risk management and aid worker protection

Objective 2: Strengthen awareness and implementation of the Saving Lives Together (SLT) framework

Objective 3: Lead policy engagement and practical guidance on emerging threats, including armed drones

Objective 4: Strengthen SRM networks and enabling infrastructure for NGOs through collective approaches</narrative>
